< HTTP/1.1 200 OK
< content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
< etag: "310e342b82df7189"
< access-control-allow-origin: *
< date: Fri, 10 Oct 2025 01:20:00 GMT
< connection: close
< content-length: 10600
<
(10600 bytes, sha256 310e342b82df7189)
(the server closed the connection)
-- a malformed chunk size is a 400 and the connection closes
== connection 5: 79 bytes in 6 pieces
[server] 400 a malformed chunk size
< HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
< content-type: application/json
< date: Fri, 10 Oct 2025 01:20:00 GMT
< connection: close
< content-length: 47
<
{"error":"a malformed chunk size","status":400}
(the server closed the connection)
-- a chunk whose data runs past its size is a 400
== connection 6: 86 bytes in 8 pieces
[server] 400 a chunk without its CR LF
< HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
< content-type: application/json
< date: Fri, 10 Oct 2025 01:20:00 GMT
< connection: close
< content-length: 50
<
{"error":"a chunk without its CR LF","status":400}
(the server closed the connection)
-- gzip under chunked is not supported
