[server] 501 a coding before chunked
< HTTP/1.1 501 Not Implemented
< content-type: application/json
< date: Fri, 10 Oct 2025 01:20:00 GMT
< connection: close
< content-length: 48
<
{"error":"a coding before chunked","status":501}
